  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reflecting-content-attributes-in-idl-attributes\n\n> 2.7.1 Reflecting content attributes in IDL attributes\n\nLooking at this section, it seems to me that we should do a transparent reflection for 'ping' given that it is a USVString but not a URL. There is no other section about reflecting an attribute a USVString attribute which contains a list of URLs.\n\nHowever, this does not seem to be the behavior of Firefox or the behavior expected by the reflection tests in the web-platform-tests. Firefox passes the web-platform-tests it seems and seems to parse all URLs in the content attribute when reflecting.\n",
